    <mxCell id="nt0" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules:&lt;/b&gt; one tender per order, no split between wallet and card (P-16); a top-up is captured at authorize and cannot be refunded to the card in v1 (P-17); real money never lands here (D-10)." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
