    <mxCell id="nt0" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules:&lt;/b&gt; no fact topic goes out (nobody downstream acts on a delivery status); OTP is gRPC because Identity waits; aggregator orders are skipped by the rules." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
